  "title": "Preventing downtime with maintenance and spares",
  "summary": "Downtime in a poultry processing plant is extremely costly, both financially and reputationally. Even a single underperforming machine can disrupt the entire process. At JBT Marel, preventing downtime is our priority. Because we know that a defective part can bring your operations to a standstill, our priority is to get you back up and running as quickly as possible. Through a combination of preventive maintenance and timely spare parts, we are partnering with you to help you maintain lifetime performance across your operation.",
